 "strings": {
  "Thanks.": "",
  "Yagami-san?": "",
  "Yagami-sensei!": "",
  "What about Emi?\nAren't you gonna ask me about her?": "",
  "I... didn't kill Emi, either.": "",
  "I told you before I\nnever would have killed her!": "",
  "Aren't you going\nto ask about that?": "",
  "I... I want to believe you.": "",
  "That's... That case is closed.": "",
  "I really do. But I already did everything I could.\nI searched nonstop for some kinda hint.": "",
  "I'd love to believe you're innocent,\nbut I did everything in my power three years ago.": "",
  "But a guy can only spend so long poring\nover burnt scraps of evidence.": "",
  "I looked over what little evidence\nthat didn't burn a thousand times.": "",
  "After three years...\nI'm not holding out much hope.": "",
  "You think something new is gonna\npop up after all this time?": "",
  "Right...": "",
  "Guess the real killer's still out there.\nJust biding his time. Waiting for my execution.": "",
  "Then Emi's killer is just laughing,\nwaiting for me to die?": "",
  "How are you and I gonna\nface Emi in the afterlife?": "",
  "I can't face Emi\nin the afterlife like this!": "",
  "C'mon man, tell me how!": "",
  "Not me, and not you!": "",
  "Why are you two here?": "",
  "Doctor Shono?\nWhat is it?": "",
  "Shono-sensei? What is it?": "",
  "How did you get in here?": "",
  "How'd you get in here!?": "",
  "We just wanna ask you\na few questions, Dr. Shono.": "",
  "We've got a question\nthat really needs an answer.": "",
  "Well, I don't have anything\nI can say to you.": "",
  "There's nothing I can tell you!": "",
  "Apologies. I need you\nto handle this.": "",
  "Apologies, but you'll have\nto handle the rest today.": "",
  "I have to go.": "",
  "I need to go.": "",
  "Where are you going?\nThis won't take long!": "",
  "I promise we'll make this quick!": "",
  "Sorry, I can't let you go any further.": "",
  "Excuse me!\nYou need to stay where you are.": "",
  "Call security.": "",
  "Call security!": "",
  "Shono!": "",
  "Let's go, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Let's do it, Yagami-san!": "",
  "We can't let him get away!\nIt's our only chance!": "",
  "Shono's gonna get away otherwise!": "",
  "And once you made sure you\ncould pin the blame on Okubo...": "",
  "After you made it look\nlike Okubo did it...": "",
  "You set fire to\nthe whole apartment.": "",
  "You set fire to the apartment.": "",
  "What evidence do you have to—": "",
  "What are you basing any of this on!?": "",
  "Don't worry.": "",
  "I can't prove it yet.": "",
  "I don't have any proof...": "",
  "But I'm damn near positive\nI'm on the right track. ": "",
  "But I'm not wrong\nabout it either.": "",
  "I can see it in your eyes.": "",
  "Your eyes are a dead giveaway.  ": "",
  "Look. ": "",
  "I know what you're thinking.": "",
  "Tell me if I've got this right.": "",
  "AD-9 will save countless people... Meaning there's\nno way you're not doing the right thing.": "",
  "You're thinking once AD-9\nis finished, lives will be saved.": "",
  "We'll I'm sorry\nto break it to you, Shono...": "",
  "So no matter what it costs now...": "",
  "But that's just not true.": "",
  "I'm doing the right thing.": "",
  "You know, when someone thinks they're in the right...\nThat's when the real cruelty in people starts to come out.": "",
  "People are at their worst\nwhen they're sure they're in the right.": "",
  "So what do you say, Shono?": "",
  "But is what you're doing...": "",
  "Are you really right?": "",
  "...Really right?": "",
  "Just what is going on\nin here, dammit!?": "",
  "What's going on in here!?": "",
  "Oh, hey.\nWe were just heading out.": "",
  "Oh, hi.\nWe were just on our way out.": "",
  "Why you...": "",
  "You little...": "",
  "And by the way...\nSo sorry to hear about AD-9.": "",
  "AD-9's not really doing so hot, is it?": "",
  "Maybe you, uh...\nneed a few more humans to test it on?": "",
  "Think you'll need a few\nmore human guinea pigs?": "",
  "Don't worry. Shono-san here\ndidn't tell us a damn thing.": "",
  "Don't worry.\nShono-san has kept his mouth shut.": "",
  "But hey.": "",
  "I'm gonna find out the truth.": "",
  "I'm gonna expose everything.": "",
  "Even if it's the last thing I do.": "",
  "And it'll be poetic coming from me.": "",
  "Whoops. My foot slipped.": "",
  "Whoops, my bad. ": "",
  "How clumsy of me.": "",
  "My foot musta slipped.": "",
  "That hurt? Huh?": "",
  "Did that hurt?": "",
  "I asked you if it hurt!": "",
  "Please...! I didn't kill her!": "",
  "I didn't do it...!": "",
  "You have to believe me!": "",
  "I didn't do anything!": "",
  "Crying's not gonna\nhelp you now, kid.": "",
  "You've got no right to cry.": "",
  "Just like it didn't\nhelp Emi Terasawa.": "",
  "Emi Terasawa was crying while you\nstabbed her over and over!": "",
  "You still stabbed her in the fucking\nstomach didn't you, you little shit!": "",
  "You're a monster!": "",
  "Look, Okubo. I don't want to go\ngetting your hopes up just yet...": "",
  "Hey... Don't get your hopes\nup just yet, but...": "",
  "But?": "",
  "Just listen.": "",
  "You're...": "",
  "I was gonna say...\nI believe you.": "",
  "Innocent.": "",
  "You didn't kill her.\nI can see that now.": "",
  "I don't think you've killed anyone.": "",
  "It'll all work out.": "",
  "Which means I'm...": "",
  "I'm gonna avenge Emi-chan.": "",
  "I'm going to avenge Emi-chan.": "",
  "And I swear I'm gonna\nget you out of here.": "",
  "And I'm going to get you out of here.": "",
  "I promise.": "",
  "I swear.": "",
  "Sorry, I... I should have said\nthat to you a lot sooner.": "",
  "I know...\nI should have told you a lot sooner.": "",
  "What was I doing...? ": "",
  "But for whatever reason...": "",
  "These three years...": "",
  "For three years...": "",
  "I didn't do a damn thing\nto help you!": "",
  "I didn't do a damn thing!": "",
  "So, uh...": "",
  "So I'm asking...": "",
  "Will you give me another chance?": "",
  "Will you give me a chance to make it right?": "",
  "Of course I will.": "",
  "Of course.": "",
  "It should be me...": "",
  "Thank you so much!": "",
  "...Begging you for this, Yagami-sensei!": "",
  "Kaito-san?　": "",
  "I swear it's like...": "",
  "Something feels off...": "",
  "Like I can feel someone watching me.": "",
  "I think I'm being watched.": "",
  "Are you there?": "",
  "Can you hear me?": "",
  "Uh, I could use a hand here!": "",
  "Hey, Kaito-san, where are you!?": "",
  "I'm right behind you buddy!": "",
  "Behind you! Incoming!": "",
  "C'mon man, why would you bring more!?": "",
  "Why are you bringing more with you!?": "",
  "You're out of options.": "",
  "Had enough yet?": "",
  "Hey. I got him.": "",
  "Check it out, I got him.": "",
  "Okay... I know you work for Hamura.": "",
  "You're one of Hamura's men, right?": "",
  "I want to know where he is.": "",
  "Where is he?": "",
  "When he finds you,\nyou're dead, Yagami.": "",
  "You're a dead man, Yagami.": "",
  "What was that?": "",
  "The hell?": "",
  "You should really see the look\non your face right now, Kaito.": "",
  "Looks like the tables\nhave turned, Kaito.": "",
  "Hamura!?": "",
  "Higashi?": "",
  "Higashi!?": "",
  "Boss...!": "",
  "I gave you every chance\nto walk away from this.": "",
  "I gave you more than enough chances.": "",
  "You just couldn't mind\nyour own business, could you. ": "",
  "And you turned them all down.": "",
  "And now you're gonna die for it.": "",
  "Now it's time to pay the price!": "",
  "You pushed this one too far.": "",
  "You guys took it too far.": "",
  "Hamura!": "",
  "Hamura...!": "",
  "Killing you is gonna feel real good.": "",
  "You've been a real\npain in my ass.": "",
  "Is this really necessary?": "",
  "Wait. Hold on a second.": "",
  "Don't make this harder\nthan it needs to be. Okay?": "",
  "Let's not make this any\nharder than it needs to be.": "",
  "Don't you think I've pulled enough\nof the family's weight already?": "",
  "I've done everything in my\npower to do right by you.": "",
  "Please don't.": "",
  "Please...": "",
  "I don't care how much like\nsons these two are to you. ": "",
  "Maybe you see this kid like a son...": "",
  "Your loyalty...\nis to the Matsugane Family first.": "",
  "But you're the\nMatsugane Family patriarch first!": "",
  "Besides, you know\nthere's no other way.": "",
  "You know this is\nthe way it has to be.": "",
  "Are you out of your fucking mind?": "",
  "Don't give me that shit, asshole.": "",
  "You need to lower the gun right now!": "",
  "You've got no right to point\na gun at the boss!": "",
  "No, Kaito!": "",
  "Don't, Kaito!": "",
  "You shut your goddamn mouth!": "",
  "You're the one who's outta line!": "",
  "No! Don't!\nWe have to get out of here!": "",
  "Don't!\nWe've gotta get outta here now!": "",
  "You're not getting away!": "",
  "Surprised you decided to stick around.\nNot gonna try and run?": "",
  "You're still here, huh?\nThe getaway car leave without you?": "",
  "Go fuck yourself, Tak.": "",
  "Fuck you.": "",
  "Let him go right now.": "",
  "Let Kaito-san go!": "",
  "Heh. What makes you think\nyou have the upper hand here?": "",
  "You think you're the one\ngiving orders here?": "",
  "Kaito-san...?": "",
  "Hey, he sounds worried.": "",
  "Hey. You hearing this?": "",
  "You piece of shit!": "",
  "You fucker...": "",
  "You asked for it.": "",
  "Serves you right.": "",
  "This time let's finish it\nfor real, asshole.": "",
  "This time we're gonna settle this!": "",
  "That all?": "",
  "You little...!": "",
  "Just need a minute, Kaito-san.": "",
  "Give me just a second, okay?": "",
  "Sure, what's the rush?": "",
  "Make it a quick second...": "",
  "This what you want?": "",
  "You want your fight?": "",
  "I'm going to fucking kill you!": "",
  "I'm gonna make this painful!": "",
  "So you just want me to abduct\nthese Kyorei guys?": "",
  "You want us to abduct\nKyorei Clan members?": "",
  "You don't want 'em dead?": "",
  "Not kill them?": "",
  "That is correct.": "",
  "That's correct.": "",
  "And your reward...": "",
  "The reward...": "",
  "Is 100 million yen each.": "",
  "...Is 100 million yen a man.": "",
  "Real funny. ": "",
  "Is this a joke?": "",
  "Last time it was 10 for a hit job.\nWhy give us so much more to kidnap a few guys?": ""
 },
